    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by subsections (1) and (4) of section 2 of the Fauna and Flora Protection Ordinance (Chapter 469), I, Hettithanthri Patabendige Dammika, Minister of Environment, do by this Order declare that -",
    "fonts": [
