    "bbox": [
      63.0,
      514.08,
      486.54,
      527.55
    ],
    "text": "(a) the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2383/05 of May 06, 2024 is hereby rescinded; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      62.99,
      538.08,
      542.47,
      575.55
    ],
    "text": "(b) the area of land described in the Schedule to the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1956/13 of March 01, 2016, shall, with effect from the date of publication of this Order, be a Nature Reserve and such Nature Reserve shall be called and known as the \u201cWedithalathive Nature Reserve\u201d.",
